Package: bcmlr
Type: Package
Title: Generalized Bayesian Multiple Changepoint Analysis
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Yuhui", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "87951710+YuhuiChloe@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Generalized Bayesian changepoint analysis for ordered vector-valued
    observations using multinomial log loss, Polya-Gamma data augmentation,
    Gaussian or horseshoe coefficient priors, and classification-based
    selection of the number of changepoints. Provides posterior summaries that help interpret the nature of the detected changepoints.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    BayesLogit,
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    LearnBayes,
    MASS,
    pROC,
    rlang,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    ecp,
    reticulate
URL: https://github.com/YuhuiChloe/bcmlr
BugReports: https://github.com/YuhuiChloe/bcmlr/issues
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
